  "description": "All new for 2021 is our Pistol Pete Loncarevich Signature series. The Haro Pistol 29\". The frame has been constructed by using 6061 aluminum with sealed mid BB and internal threaded fork. Cr-Mo 4130 fork and bar, with Haro's own 3-piece 8 spline tubular cranks. 36 spoke double wall rims with high flange alloy hubs. Finished off with a lineage pivotal seat and pivotal post.\n100% 6061 alloy Pistol frame with Mid BB shell, integrated head tube and 7mm Group 1 dropouts\n100% chromoly fork with internal threaded steer tube, tapered legs and 5mm dropouts\n100% chromoly Haro Freestyler cruiser bars with Haro 1978 alloy top load stem\nHaro 1978 3-piece chromoly 175mm cranks with Haro 39T sprocket and sealed Mid BB\n39/17 gearing (26\") / 39/16 gearing (29\")\nFully sealed wheels with high flange hubs and double-wall alloy rims\nKenda Kranium tires front and rear\nHaro Lineage padded Pivotal seat with alloy Pivotal post\nHaro \"1978\" plastic pedals\nPistol pad-set\nHaro Team grips\nPromax alloy V-brake and lever",
